  "hindi": "यह बुद्धिमान् स्वराट् आदित्य का है; यह अपनी महिमा से सब पर छा जाए। जो देव अत्यन्त आनन्ददायक है और यजन के योग्य है, उस महान् वरुण की उत्तम कीर्ति मैं माँगता हूँ।",
  "english": "May this of the wise Āditya, the self-ruler, prevail over all things by its greatness. I ask for the good fame of great Varuṇa, the god who is exceedingly gladdening, for worship.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "The form 'sānti' (printed sāntyabhyastu) is not clear to the drafter: the line may read viśvāni sānti abhy astu, but the word sānti is not understood with confidence and is left unglossed in the translation. 'ati' is taken as an adverb (exceedingly) with mandraḥ; its construction is uncertain. 'idam' has no noun in the verse; it is rendered as the bare pronoun.",
  "confidence": "low"
 },
